    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a real-time tactical minesweeper. Compete against computer on various maps. The one who opens majority of cells faster and does not explode - wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time game of minesweeper against computer engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 maps of various sizes and shapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different computer levels - from easy to hard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configurable mines density on each map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configurable lives per game. If you make a mistake, you lose one life, not a game at once</p></li></ul>",
